	 * `reanalyzeFunction` <- `replaceFreeNames` <- `replaceVersionReads` <-
	 * `toConstSsa`. `reanalyzeFunction`'s own doc comment records the same chain.
	 *
	 * `buildEnrichedIr` and `validateEnrichedIr` BOTH succeeded - unlike the Solid
